ised HCP endpoint and are forced onto an ephemeral port.\n\nEvidence:\n- `E:\\Projects\\Code\\AI\\Ji\\ji-java\\products\\ji-spring-boot-starter\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\spring\\JiHost.java:9-10`\n- `E:\\Projects\\Code\\AI\\Ji\\ji-java\\products\\ji-spring-boot-starter\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\spring\\JiHostProperties.java:8-14`\n- `E:\\Projects\\Code\\AI\\Ji\\ji-java\\products\\ji-spring-boot-starter\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\spring\\JiHostAutoConfiguration.java:34-35`\n- `E:\\Projects\\Code\\AI\\Ji\\ji-java\\products\\ji-cli\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\cli\\LocalHostApplication.java:29-32`"}]